cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: mesa-notebook-updater
abstract: >-
  An Agent Skill that migrates Mesa agent-based models and teaching notebooks
  between Mesa releases, in either direction, using a lifecycle database of the
  Mesa API rather than pattern-matching on the current version. It computes what
  is current at a named target version, rewrites code to that target's idiom,
  and holds the surrounding teaching text to a minimal-delta contract.
type: software
